    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			330
		</span></i> (s.v.l.)), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yearly, annual,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄεθλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).67
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					435
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>of the year,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					68
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταλλαγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					330
				</span></i>
			 (prob.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτεία, ἡ,</span>
			<i>yearly board of officials</i> or <i>the term of such a
			board</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				559.45
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>, but <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>): neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτεια,</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				721
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lasting a year,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρουρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of one year, yearling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
